ed","instructions":"Have the authorized platform operator record the successful test and complete the separate public voice review and activation for the intended website. Restricted-test acceptance does not authorize public calls.\n\nCheck Call status again, verify the actual public website voice entry and fallback, and allow calls when ready. Pause receptionist permission whenever you need to stop new conversations or review a problem. Keep approved answers, business hours and limits current."},{"title":"Add appointments only if needed","instructions":"Appointment readiness is optional. Calls and caller-confirmed inquiries can be approved without booking.\n\nConnect the existing calendar, map the approved service, choose notice limits and review the separate appointment capability with your authorized operator. Test it before use. Saving appointment settings alone cannot book an appointment or send an invitation; the caller must separately confirm an available, accepted booking and any invitation."}]}
